WEBVTT

01:04:35.488 --> 01:04:37.155
Stupid dog.

01:04:44.914 --> 01:04:46.456
Lean back!

01:04:51.337 --> 01:04:54.798
Mission Control, is the
launch pad construction complete?

01:04:54.882 --> 01:04:57.425
Roger. Rocket is now
secured to guide wire.

01:04:57.510 --> 01:05:01.096
We are currently obtaining
the ignition sticks.
